src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1153:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupacket.note4: "※Please use Yu-Pack if you require coverage."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1154:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.title: "●Yu-Pack (from ¥550)"
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1155:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.li1: Ships via Japan Post Yu-Pack service.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1156:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.li2: "Depending on the region, delivery can arrive as early as the next morning, making it ideal if you're in a hurry."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1157:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.li3: Date and time specification is also available. Please use Yu-Pack if you wish to specify a delivery date or time.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1158:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.note1: "※Free shipping on orders totaling ¥30,000 or more."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1159:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.note2: "※In the event of a postal accident, compensation is generally limited to actual damages up to ¥500,000."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1160:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.note3: "※If a package is not received and returned after the holding period, an additional shipping fee may be charged."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1161:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.note4: "※To request post office hold delivery, please enter the post office name and address in the notes field."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1162:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.title: "●Combined Shipping"
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1163:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.li1: "By selecting [Combined Shipping] as your shipping method, you can combine multiple orders into a single shipment."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1164:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.li2: "Please enter the Order ID of the order you wish to combine in the notes field and select [Combined Shipping] as your shipping method."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1165:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.li3: We will ship your combined orders together.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1166:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.note1: "※Combined shipping is not available if any of the orders to be combined use Credit Card, Cash on Delivery, or Convenience Store Payment."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1167:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.note2: "※The maximum number of orders that can be combined, including the base order, is 3."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1168:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.note3: "※If you request combined shipping for a 4th or more order, we will combine up to the 3rd order, and combined shipping for the 4th order onwards will not be available."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1169:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.note4: "※Combined shipping is not available for orders that include pre-order items."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1170:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.note5: "※If payment has already been received, we may not be able to accommodate your request."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1171:front.shopping.payment_modal.heading: Payment Information
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1172:front.shopping.payment_modal.deadline.title: Payment Deadline
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1173:front.shopping.payment_modal.deadline.body: "Payment is due by 15:00 (JST) on the 7th day after the order date.<br>If the due date falls on a holiday for financial institutions, the deadline will be 15:00 on the next business day.<br>-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-<br>Example: If ordered on April 1, the deadline is 15:00 on April 7.<br>(If April 7 is a Sunday, the deadline is 15:00 on April 8.)<br>-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-<br>※Orders past the payment deadline will be cancelled. If your payment will be delayed, please contact us in advance."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1174:front.shopping.payment_modal.methods.title: Payment Methods
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1175:front.shopping.payment_modal.methods.intro: The following 5 payment methods are available.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1176:front.shopping.payment_modal.methods.li1: ●Credit Card
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1177:front.shopping.payment_modal.methods.li2: ●Cash on Delivery
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1178:front.shopping.payment_modal.methods.li3: ●Convenience Store Payment
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1179:front.shopping.payment_modal.methods.li4: ●Bank Transfer
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1180:front.shopping.payment_modal.methods.li5: ●Postal Transfer
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1181:front.shopping.payment_modal.credit.title: "●Credit Card<br>The following credit cards are accepted."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1182:front.shopping.payment_modal.credit.li1: ・Visa
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1183:front.shopping.payment_modal.credit.li2: ・JCB
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1184:front.shopping.payment_modal.credit.li3: ・Mastercard
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1185:front.shopping.payment_modal.credit.li4: ・American Express
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1186:front.shopping.payment_modal.credit.li5: "・Diner's Club"
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1187:front.shopping.payment_modal.credit.notes: "Your credit card statement will show \"Hareruya\" as the merchant name.<br>※Installment payments are not supported. Only lump-sum payment is available.<br>※We cannot change payment methods from other options to credit card.<br>※Combined shipping is not available for orders paid by credit card."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1188:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.title: "●Cash on Delivery<br>Cash on delivery is available via Japan Post. The cash on delivery fee is based on the total payment amount (product price + shipping + COD fee) as follows.<br>※We cannot change payment methods from other options to cash on delivery.<br>-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-"
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1189:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.fee1: "¥0 – under ¥30,000 ・・・ ¥330"
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1190:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.fee2: "¥30,000 – under ¥100,000 ・・・ ¥550"
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1191:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.fee3: "¥100,000 – under ¥200,000 ・・・ ¥880"
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1192:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.fee4: "¥200,000 – under ¥300,000 ・・・ ¥990"
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1193:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.fee5: "¥300,000 – under ¥500,000 ・・・ ¥1,430"
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1194:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.notes: "-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-<br>※Cash on delivery is a payment method where the delivery carrier collects payment upon delivery.<br>※Please pay the total amount (including shipping and COD fee) in cash to the delivery carrier.<br>※If a package is not received and returned after the holding period, an additional shipping fee may be charged.<br>※An additional COD fee applies on top of the standard shipping fee.<br>※Shipping will be via Yu-Pack.<br>※Combined shipping is not available for orders using cash on delivery."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1195:front.shopping.payment_modal.convenience.title: "●Convenience Store Payment<br>Payment can be made at the following convenience stores."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1196:front.shopping.payment_modal.convenience.li1: ・7-Eleven
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1197:front.shopping.payment_modal.convenience.li2: ・Lawson
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1198:front.shopping.payment_modal.convenience.li3: ・FamilyMart
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1199:front.shopping.payment_modal.convenience.li4: ・Ministop
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1200:front.shopping.payment_modal.convenience.li5: ・Daily Yamazaki
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1201:front.shopping.payment_modal.convenience.notes: "Please pay at the selected convenience store.<br>※Payment procedures differ by store — please refer to your order confirmation email for details.<br>※We cannot change payment methods from other options to convenience store payment.<br>※Combined shipping is not available for orders using convenience store payment."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1202:front.shopping.payment_modal.bank.title: ●Bank Transfer
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1203:front.shopping.payment_modal.bank.intro: Bank transfer payment is available.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1204:front.shopping.payment_modal.bank.info: "Bank: MUFG Bank (Mitsubishi UFJ Bank)<br>・Branch: Takadanobaba Branch (053)<br>・Account type: Ordinary<br>・Account number: 0472843<br>・Account name: Kabushiki Gaisha Hareruya (KABUSHIKI GAISHA HARERUYA)"
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1205:front.shopping.payment_modal.postal.title: ●Postal Transfer
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1206:front.shopping.payment_modal.postal.info: "Postal transfer payment is available.<br>・Account number: 10100-30613341<br>・Account name: Ka) Hareruya"
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1209:front.shopping.accept_order: I confirm the above order details.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1211:front.shopping.remarks.confirm: I confirm the above order.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1222:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.tab.reserve: About Pre-order Items
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1223:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.tab.return: About Returns
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1224:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.heading: Pre-order Items
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1225:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.order.title: ・Ordering Pre-order Items
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1226:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.order.li1: "We do not accept [Combined Shipping / Additional Orders] for orders that include pre-order items."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1227:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.order.li2: We do not accept pre-order item orders placed from the Tournament Center Tokyo in-store account.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1228:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.order.li3: Please place your order from your own customer account.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1229:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.limit.title: ・Pre-order Quantity Limit for Single Cards
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1230:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.limit.li1: For single card pre-orders only, the maximum pre-order quantity is limited to 4 copies.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1231:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.limit.li2: Even if you place multiple separate orders, please ensure your total order quantity during the pre-order period does not exceed 4 copies.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1232:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.cancel.title: ・Cancellations
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1233:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.cancel.li1: Due to the nature of pre-order items, we cannot accept cancellations for customer convenience.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1234:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.cancel.li2: Please consider carefully before placing a pre-order.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1235:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.payment.title: ・Payment for Pre-order Items
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1236:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.payment.li1: Payment is due within 7 days including the order date.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1237:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.payment.li2: All payment methods are available for pre-order items.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1238:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.payment.li3: If you select bank transfer or postal transfer and your payment will be delayed, please contact us in advance.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1239:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.payment.note: "※For single card pre-orders, all payment methods except in-store payment are available.<br>※For all pre-order items, credit card payments are charged on the order date."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1240:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.shipping.title: ・Shipping of Pre-order Items
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1241:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.shipping.li1: "Pre-order items are scheduled to ship on the official release date. (※We may ship the day before the release date in some cases.)"
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1242:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.shipping.li2: If you request delivery before the release date, your order will ship on or after the official release date.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1243:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.shipping.li3: "For customers who do not specify a delivery date, we will ship as quickly as possible after the release date."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1244:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.shipping.note: "※In rare cases, packages may not arrive on the specified date due to traffic or weather conditions. We are not responsible for such delays."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1245:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.congestion.title: ・Notice on High Demand
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1246:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.reserve.congestion.body: "We receive a large volume of orders on new set release days.<br>While we guarantee same-day shipping, there may be delays compared to normal. We appreciate your understanding."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1247:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.heading: Return and Exchange Policy
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1248:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.customer.title: Returns / Exchanges for Customer Convenience
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1249:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.customer.body: "The products we handle are predominantly used goods (secondhand items), many of which are one-of-a-kind. For this reason, we cannot accept returns or exchanges based on customer convenience (e.g., \"it was different from what I imagined,\" \"I ordered by mistake\"), except in cases of product non-conformity."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1250:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.title: Returns / Exchanges Due to Product Non-conformity
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1251:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.policy.title: ① Basic Policy
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1252:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.policy.body: "If the delivered product differs from your order, or falls under the non-conformity conditions defined below, please contact us within 8 days of receiving your order. We will arrange an exchange or refund (return) at our shipping expense."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1253:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.condition.title: ② Product Condition and Contract Details
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1254:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.condition.body1: "We inspect and describe product conditions on our product pages based on our own standards, taking into account the nature of used goods, in order to provide customers with an accurate understanding of item condition. Detailed condition standards are available on a separate page."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1255:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.condition.body2: "Customers are deemed to have read and agreed to the product condition descriptions on the product page and in our standards before making a purchase.<br>The product condition described on the product page constitutes the agreed quality terms between the customer and our company."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1256:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.applicable.title: "③ Cases Eligible for Return / Exchange (Non-conformity)"
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1257:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.applicable.li1: The delivered product differs from the ordered product.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1258:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.applicable.li2: The product has obvious damage not described on the product page or in our detailed condition standards.
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1259:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.not_applicable.title: "④ Cases Not Eligible for Return / Exchange"
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1260:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.not_applicable.li1: "Scratches, stains, or age-related deterioration already noted on the product page."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1261:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.not_applicable.li2: "Cases where the customer's subjective assessment (e.g., \"the damage is more noticeable than I expected\") does not conflict with the product condition description provided on the product page."
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1262:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.not_applicable.li3: "9 or more days have passed since the product was received."
